   "id": "c8ece666",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 3. Routing functions and graph assembly\n",
    "\n",
    "`ToolNode(..., handle_tool_errors=True)` converts invalid tool calls / tool exceptions into error messages the agent can recover from, instead of crashing the graph."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 37,
   "id": "098c4d11",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "PNG rendering unavailable: Failed to reach https://mermaid.ink API while trying to render your graph after 1 retries. To resolve this issue:\n",
      "1. Check your internet connection and try again\n",
      "2. Try with higher retry settings: `draw_mermaid_png(..., max_retries=5, retry_delay=2.0)`\n",
